---
layout: base.njk
title: Concept
permalink: /concept/
description: Le Reformer en mode On. 3 étapes, pas plus.
---

{% if not pages.concept.hideHero %}
<section class="page-hero">
  {% if not pages.concept.hideKicker %}<span class="page-hero__kicker">{{ pages.concept.kicker or "Le concept" }}</span>{% endif %}
  {% if not pages.concept.hideTitle %}<h1 class="page-hero__h">{% if pages.concept.title %}{{ pages.concept.title | replace('[[', '<span class="hl-box">') | replace(']]', '</span>') | safe }}{% else %}Le Reformer.<br>En mode <span class="logo logo--inline-yellow" style="vertical-align: baseline; gap: 0.02em;">{% include "toggle.njk" %}<span class="logo__text">N.</span></span>{% endif %}</h1>{% endif %}
  {% if not pages.concept.hideSubtitle %}<p class="page-hero__p">{% if pages.concept.subtitle %}{{ pages.concept.subtitle | replace('[[', '<span class="hl-box">') | replace(']]', '</span>') | safe }}{% else %}3 étapes. Pas plus. Un studio autonome, ouvert de 6h à 22h30.{% endif %}</p>{% endif %}
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if blocks and blocks.list %}{% for block in blocks.list %}{% if not block.hidden and ("concept" in (block.pages or [])) %}{% include "render-block.njk" %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}

<section class="cta-band reveal">
  <h2 class="cta-band__h">Prêt<br>à tester&nbsp;?</h2>
  <div class="cta-band__side">
    <p class="cta-band__p" style="color: var(--vanille); opacity: 1;">Teste 3 séances avec le Pack Découverte. Sans engagement.</p>
    <div class="cta-band__actions">
      <a href="/tarifs/" class="btn btn--ecru">Voir les tarifs <span class="btn__toggle"></span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
